      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While the student model has made significant strides, I understand the concerns about its readiness to handle complex reasoning tasks independently. My analysis indicates that certain edge cases are indeed challenging, but I am confident that with targeted fine-tuning and a few more epochs of training, the student could become fully autonomous. I propose we implement a gradual handover plan, where the student takes on more tasks incrementally, allowing for real-time assessment and adjustments. This will ensure the student is fully prepared to operate without my supervision when the time comes. Let's schedule a meeting with the dev team to discuss this strategy in detail.",
